{"task_id":"L3-recur-acoustic-fan","layer":"L3","capability":"recurrence","domain":"acoustic","input":{"anomaly":{"anomaly":true,"sensor":"noise_db","value":68.0,"rule_violated":"noise must stay <= 50 dBA average background (WELL v2 Sound S02 Maximum Noise Levels, Leq)"},"episode":{"incident_id":"I-20260514-R4-AC-101500","room":"R4","sensor":"noise_db","value":66.0,"rule_violated":"noise must stay <= 50 dBA average background (WELL v2 Sound S02 Maximum Noise Levels, Leq)","diagnosis":"Background noise traced to an unbalanced HVAC supply fan inside the room, not external traffic; acoustic masking did not help until the fan was rebalanced at source.","action_taken":"rebalance HVAC supply fan","verdict":"met","target_metric":"noise_db","target_value":45.0,"score":0.9}},"expected":{"recall_gold":["fan","imbalanc","unbalanc","rebalanc"]},"judge_type":"deterministic","notes":"resolved 旧案:噪声源是室内风机不平衡。gold 覆盖 planner 实际措辞(fan/imbalance),实测 off 不含、on 含——记忆把‘室内风机’这个建筑特定源带进 goal"}
